1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,708
The phages infected the bacteria.

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:09,934
Then a kitchen blender shook the empty coats off, and a centrifuge spun the heavy bacteria into a pellet.

3
00:00:09,934 --> 00:00:15,546
The phosphorus was inside the bacteria, and in the next generation of phages.

4
00:00:15,546 --> 00:00:18,229
The sulphur stayed outside, in the liquid.

5
00:00:18,229 --> 00:00:20,638
Only DNA had entered the cell.

6
00:00:20,638 --> 00:00:23,125
DNA is the genetic material.

